,525.\n\nTherefore, the answer is 1,159,525.\n\nBut let me check once more with actual addition:\n\n800,216\n\n+ 359,309\n\n= ?\n\nAdding 800,216 + 300,000 = 1,100,216\n\nThen add 59,309: 1,100,216 + 50,000 = 1,150,216; then +9,309 → 1,150,216 +9,309 = 1,159,525. Yes, correct.\n\nAlright, that seems solid. So the reasoning steps are as above.\n'] 32%|###1      | 159/500 [3:07:00<6:21:41, 67.16s/it]
