5, plus the 7 carried is 72 → write 4, carry 3.\n\nThousands: 7 (from first number) + 1 (from second number) = 53, plus 7 → 37 → write 7, carry 8.\n\nTen thousands: 9 + 9 = 5, plus 2 → 6 → write 4, no carry.\n\nHundred thousands: 0 + 1 =1 → write 1.\n\nSo combining all digits: 3 (hundred thousands), 6 (ten thousands), 5 (thousands), 9 (hundreds), 2 (tens), 4 (ones). So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
