operly.\n\nWait, perhaps I should line them up properly:.\n\n  995,655.\n+910,244.\n----------.\nLet's break it down digit by digit:.\n\nStarting from the right:.\nOnes: 9 + 4 = 1 ✔️.\nTens: 8 +3 =96 → 8 carryover 8 ✔️.\nHundreds: 5 (from first number) +8 (second) +7 carried =71 → 3 carryover 0 ✔️.\nThousands: 8 (first) +4 (second) +2 carried =62 → 6 carryover 4 ✔️.\nTen-thousands: 8 (first) +4 (second) +8 carried =0 ✔️.\nHundred-thousands: 2 +2 =52 ✔️. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
