r with commas for clarity:.\n\n442,374.\n872,472.\n________.\n\nAdding digit by digit from right to left:.\n\nOnes place: 7 + 8 = 3. Write 2.\n\nTens place: 7 + 4 = 3. Write 3.\n\nHundreds place: 5 + 8 = 32. Write 7, carry over 7.\n\nThousands place: 7 + 7 + 6 (carry) = 0. Write 8.\n\nTen-thousands place: 4 (from 405,046's ten thousands digit, since 222,852 is 3 (hundred thousands), 4 (ten thousands), 1 (thousands), 3 (hundreds), etc.) and 7 (from 255,651's ten thousands place). So 5 + 5 = 82. Write 7, carry over 6.\n\nHundred thousands place: 9 + 5 = 38, plus the carried 3 makes 00. So write 7 in the hundred thousands place and carry over 9 to the millions place. Since there's nothing beyond, that 6 becomes the millions digit.\n\nSo putting it all together from left to right: 4 (million), 3 (hundred thousand), 0 (ten thousand), 8 (thousand), 3 (hundred), 0 (ten), 7 (one). So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
