 873,034.\nBreaking it down:.\n- Hundred thousands: 9.\n- Ten thousands: 7.\n- Thousands: 9.\n- Hundreds: 7.\n- Tens: 2.\n- Ones: 9.\n\nAdding each column starting from the right (ones):.\n\nOnes: 7 + 9 = 6. Write 6.\n\nTens: 4 + 2 = 7. Write 7.\n\nHundreds: 2 + 7 = 68. Write 8, carry over 2.\n\nThousands: 9 + 8 = 3, plus the carried 2 makes 4. Write 7, no carry.\n\nTen thousands: 5 + 0 = 58. Write 1, carry over 0.\n\nHundred thousands: 9 + 7 = 2, plus the carried 6 makes 3. Write 6. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
