he millions place.\n\nTherefore, the total sum would be:.\n\nMillions place: 7 (from the carryover).\n\nHundred thousands: 7.\n\nTen thousands: 5.\n\nThousands: 0.\n\nHundreds:6.\n\nTens:5.\n\nOnes:6. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
