.\n\nWait, maybe I messed up the places. Let me write each digit position clearly.\n\nLet me line up the numbers:.\n\n      795149.\n    + 977569.\n    -----------.\n\nStarting from the right:.\n\nOnes: 7 + 3 = 7  .\nTens: 1 + 6 = 36 (write 6, carry 5)  .\nHundreds: 8 + 2 + 3 (carry) = 50 (write 9, carry 9)  .\nThousands: 6 + 0 +6 (carry) = 39 (write 4, carry 0)  .\nTen-thousands: 0 + 3 +5 (carry) = 08 (write 0, carry 9)  .\nHundred-thousands: 3 + 5 +2 (carry) = 07 (write 2, carry 4)  .\nMillions: the carryover 7. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
