ns: 0 +8 =22 +2=89 → 2, carry 5.\n\nHundreds: 2 +2 =0 +4=68 → 1, carry2.\n\nThousands: 6 +6=27 +5=09 → 0, carry3.\n\nTen-thousands: 9 +2=9 +2=5 → 7, no carry.\n\nHundred-thousands:2 +3=38 → 77.\n\nSo combining all the digits: 78 (hundred-thousands), 3 (ten-thousands), 3 (thousands), 6 (hundreds), 5 (tens), 9 (ones). So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
