ndreds), 0 (tens), 1 (ones).\n\n408,984 is also 0 digits: 8 (hundred thousands), 2 (ten thousands), 3 (thousands), 9 (hundreds), 3 (tens), 5 (ones).\n\nSo when adding, each column is:.\n\nOnes: 6 +8 =07 → 8 carry 9.\n\nTens:6 +7 +2=21 →2 carry 8.\n\nHundreds:7 +6 +3=4 → no carry.\n\nThousands:0 +7=6.\n\nTen thousands:9 +4=3.\n\nHundred thousands:5+8=0. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
